sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant N as Nginx
    participant A as FastAPI app
    participant P as Route policy (deny by default)
    participant S as Service layer
    participant D as PostgreSQL

    B->>N: POST /api/v1/models/train (Bearer token)
    N->>A: proxied request
    A->>P: enforce_route_policy
    alt route declares no permission
        P-->>B: 403 (fails closed)
    else permission declared (ml:operate)
        P->>D: load account by token subject
        D-->>P: role, is_active
        P->>P: role -> permissions (registry)
        alt role lacks ml:operate
            P-->>B: 403 Forbidden
        else allowed
            P->>S: run use case
            S->>D: write model + job rows
            S-->>B: 201 Created
        end
    end
